# SUBJECTS WITH LOW AMPLITUDE TREMOR:
# REST TREMOR, CONDITION: DBS ON, MEDICATION ON (n=8 files)
#-----------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJ   FILE       RANGE VELOCITY LASER  RATE SAMPLES
# g9     g9ren.rit  0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6276
# g10    g10ren.let 0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6180
